  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:875b0e25d48ebdfb08404622",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "获得的启示",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c1aa2cf5a2f93950c195c6558ff5625e73469f15e8f3495e9fe773fb2b09272",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bcde416bcd1f4bd908bf97d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员想为第一红宝石准备\n最适合她的舞台，于是计划\n盛大地宣传“英里CS”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e08ba3286fca5224a2dc79c50e1692b22f5d436abc6e0e655fd61b1a02ce904",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e4913823633ff554f8b38ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "让众人知晓“华丽一族”现在的光芒──\n为了她的这个梦想尽心尽力，\n正是自己身为训练员的使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44ad055f9a1bc42b84a2d5cb13a75c3caf02838b14b2b9435a780fa8fbc87dfe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c42ce7e0f5f32d27e296bc57",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "他还要请第一红宝石的双亲到场。\n训练员大力保证，现在的她完全够资格\n以华丽一族的身份示人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d2f60b4c3c59326d0cfad392c4bd2f09420d9850ba3366ca13dbd10e03ca363",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:187095c96502d31b4fa01d99",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此外，他还与“华丽一族”交涉，\n让他们答应去观赏比赛。只要关注度提高，\n比赛的重要程度也会跟着水涨船高。",
      "source_fingerprint": "513944391dbbd448ca130e248a2ccb8f0b9506713792d5ab79e46d413a58023e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:706b9cd4ebcdfa7d153fb969",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员一步步地\n筹备打造着“英里CS”。\n至高舞台即将落成──",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e12fe248301f3eb1611c770496e28e03d3786488228fa95e25d823b6a69484c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46b1dd79cbe8f860b2a4771f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“华丽一族”的训练员",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6b05a89487a987c661a6903c2c63e4c9eb418409f55db2c83507414735a255f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fafa65383c1fe34fd3547361",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d6e2d485c09d58e0642567d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每年惯例的夏季集训到来。\n即使大拓太阳神吵吵闹闹的，\n第一红宝石仍旧维持一贯的冷静。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ab70288fcc533ef8c63a41953ebf2ecf23ca2972ea3b8f9f5db17c01a2e8490",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ded8dd180962b6c6448275c6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a796c9fa1a00c67c01c67b15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石希望这次集训能有丰富的收获。\n想必这会是很重要的时期。\n得为接下来的方向做出决定了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dadcdeeae5dd9b5d547aeac73ecfa268e79afec807c54575984e436afa7d1893",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32e5400656dd7ac1162b120e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b554639bb840c0b488e6503",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在夏季集训第一天早上的自主训练中，\n第一红宝石注意到凯斯奇迹的脚\n有些令人担忧的问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c66b1202006c1490547492ad7f8888531ed2dc104e65fbcf58e545aede218825",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25264d303efa6e8f27e82546",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "凯斯奇迹也早有自觉。\n但即使如此，她说她很清楚\n怎么照顾自己的身体，所以没有问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8efc7fe25776217c1c6910337aaf8d1c385b0ee3ef7a386af4c071c169dd136",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0419018526e01c25316e08d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "据说凯斯奇迹天生便身体虚弱。\n多亏了周遭人们的尽心照顾与支援，\n身体状况才进步到能够参加比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0329358e8b89ac5843009768756005d742b98cd7b8e37b63b90e7311a2c4c427",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:905286a9bd42f61d61f4f36c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "凯斯奇迹表示想要赢得GⅠ竞赛，\n以报答那份大恩。第一红宝石听到\n和自己相像的境遇，产生了共鸣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e972d4cb535a5239958582d3b75866f7890e6e15d7ac2c575193e9323474aac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c30452c00e69b1e032a1ad9f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，看着把自己逼紧的凯斯奇迹，\n第一红宝石也觉得有哪里不对劲。\n──第三年的夏季集训就在此情况下展开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e24fc1aeb7b5675ddb92eaf4fafddae1dc092caa9e778efb1b9139a899004512",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c577fb25699d12f97efa184",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第三年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef37080660583492caac78b957b8f144bbb2896156162385fc6034f5649e4df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fd8ae44cf39093e733b2a3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0156942b53e44a3cd6505467",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战即将来临。\n“华丽一族”子孙的身上聚集了\n非比寻常的期待及各种盘算……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc4db1ffa6f71b719c2f17dd1a3c4a731c3fa25035f047ecd70678f491a9de1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:258e5da8c5db029e409aaa13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04612b567b2b00a886656a82",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但第一红宝石仍然坚定不移。\n她说自己对能深受期待觉得感谢，\n而绝对没有感到负担。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a65de51203f627dc567abf4873b1bdfec6536e8351e857c88a34909c8cb764d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eda75e1ad60074e77be88b09",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43515c8a06f0128566601421",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了贯彻家族职责，\n第一红宝石一肩扛起所有期待，\n前往挑战比赛──",
      "source_fingerprint": "43eae911319a9e43b5d6688b6a44fe8d6a0f6a7d94bcdf287afa9fe32a245211",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:245d929b5d6fed0eeaf2065b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:783f91d8851afbb5866cd17b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“赛马娘赛”当天。\n“华丽一族”参赛一事\n令赛场热闹得异于平常。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61dc923802e57cc9522c58fdc994e1aae1a83ac166a959504c7f4c1abe45da07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2b22bff36240757da526300",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在其他参赛者的锐利视线下，第一红宝石仍显得\n若无其事。她说，自己会尊敬同场的对手，\n但除此之外便没有更多感情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e873966f5c0b11248fb763a015d7ceb35bbe899720cba99a0a88a76aab629fd1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3b77bd785de94dee038662e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "真正的对手只有自己。\n为了显示自己拥有足以戴上后冠的实力，\n此刻她即将挑战前哨战──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee2450cd859b5fb3482799ef31ac3cf59c8907fcf3a5b69d0026af772e3a547c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
