      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“玫瑰锦标”当天。\n有观众预测第一红宝石会直接挑战\n“秋华赏”，走上主流路线……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b0f9a28eebd880330b27d3ff37dace193dbaef8fe815dc405e87c1a659dfb30",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
