      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那之前，要先在眼前的“玫瑰锦标”\n发挥全力。为了让接下来的新旅程\n有好的开始，她即将冲刺而出──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a407e6b7d75850740a20543db73e48c90cace75653578818f4aa58806e65bab7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
