    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aa4ac52d799ada768bc16a6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“高松宫纪念”的胜负关系到\n“华丽一族”能否三代称霸。\n凯斯奇迹也到场加油。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a53ff80347d5c5aa67594ec38e21b6ce46d1ff3a4e7eb4668feffb1762614532",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
