    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da148bea57d244792c7543cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天是第一红宝石于获得新使命后，\n第一次挑战目标竞赛。曾赢得重赏比赛的\n强者大拓太阳神对她下了战帖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c55097792c18612f7c2d84604459eaee3a578347a7cbf183767b29239d65a1f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085413.json",
